# Principal Component Analysis (PCA)

## Objective

Apply Principal Component Analysis (PCA) for dimensionality reduction, feature visualization, and noise filtering using Python and Scikit-learn.

## Topics

- Feature Scaling
- Principal Component Analysis
- Dimensionality Reduction
- Explained Variance
- PCA Visualization
- High-Dimensional Data
- Noise Filtering

## Libraries

- NumPy
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn

## Files

- PCA.ipynb
- seeds.csv

## Results

The project applies PCA to the Seeds and Digits datasets, analyzes explained variance, reduces high-dimensional data to two dimensions, and demonstrates PCA as a noise filtering method.
